+    /* Entering the child's PE runs the PE-side loader (LdrInitializeThunk)
+     * for a second Windows process in this address space — which needs
+     * per-process instancing of ntdll's PE-side loader state, the documented
+     * long tail (docs/DESIGN-0003-inproc-spawn.md "per-process DLL globals").
+     * Gated so the tested attach+map path above cannot regress while that
