+    {
+        /* The child enters its PE through the normal path: LdrInitializeThunk
+         * -> loader_init, which (0003g) gives this pseudo-process its own
+         * loader state — its own module list, hash table, TLS bitmaps and
+         * one-shot gates — then builds its main module, loads its imports and
